  "title": "epan: Only call tvb_get_ptr in proto_tree_add_bytes* with a tvb",
  "description": "This restores the previous behavior of proto_tree_add_bytes with a\nNULL tvb, and also adds a guard for a NULL tvb for the _format\nand _format_value variants that didn't have one in 4.6 and before.\n\ntvb_get_ptr doesn't have a DISSECTOR_ASSERT that it has a tvb, but\nit should.\n\nFix #20975\nFixup 9de79d25274d46bc51ad95604ca445655326c180\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
